@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@customerToken = REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_BEARER_TOKEN
@managerToken = REPLACE_WITH_OWNER_OR_CURRENT_AGENCY_ADMIN_TOKEN
@providerToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCEPTED_PROVIDER_OWNER_TOKEN
@moderatorToken = REPLACE_WITH_INDEPENDENT_PLATFORM_ADMIN_TOKEN
@moderatorPassword = REPLACE_LOCALLY_DO_NOT_COMMIT_A_REAL_PASSWORD
@listingId = REPLACE_UUID
@conversationId = REPLACE_UUID
@viewingId = REPLACE_UUID
@messageId = REPLACE_UUID
@reportId = REPLACE_UUID
@organizationId = REPLACE_UUID
@propertyId = REPLACE_UUID
@leaseId = REPLACE_UUID
@workId = REPLACE_UUID
@listingVersion = 1
@conversationVersion = 1
@viewingVersion = 1
@caseVersion = 0
@conversation = {{base}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}

### Read the safe public projection and current listing version after login.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/listings/{{listingId}}/contact
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Open one enquiry for this prospect/listing. Save the returned conversation ID.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/listings/{{listingId}}/enquiries
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","listingVersion":{{listingVersion}},"message":"I would like to arrange a viewing of this property."}

### Private customer/management/provider inbox through your current authorized roles.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me/conversations?unreadOnly=true&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Organization inbox; ordinary members cannot read these conversations.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/conversations?kind=ENQUIRY&status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Current conversation and your personal unread/preferences state.
GET {{conversation}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Send plain text; retain this exact requestId/payload to retry a failed connection.
POST {{conversation}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","body":"The property is available for a viewing. Please suggest a time."}

### Bounded chronological polling. Continue after the last displayed sequence.
GET {{conversation}}/messages?after=0&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Private read cursor; the value must not exceed lastSequence.
POST {{conversation}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","throughSequence":2}

### Mute only your future ordinary conversation notifications.
POST {{conversation}}/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","muted":true}

### Initial proposal uses the current conversation version and reviewed listing version.
# Replace times with a future 15-minute–2-hour interval within 90 days.
POST {{conversation}}/viewings
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{conversationVersion}},"listingVersion":{{listingVersion}},"startAt":"2026-10-20T09:00:00Z","endAt":"2026-10-20T09:30:00Z","meetingInstructions":"Meet at the entrance agreed in this conversation.","reason":"Customer proposes a viewing time for manager confirmation."}

### Only the other side can confirm. Reload the viewing's own version first.
POST {{conversation}}/viewings/{{viewingId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{viewingVersion}},"reason":"Reviewed the listing and confirmed availability for this time."}

### Rescheduling keeps the original confirmed slot until the other party decides.
POST {{conversation}}/viewings/{{viewingId}}/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{viewingVersion}},"listingVersion":{{listingVersion}},"startAt":"2026-10-20T11:00:00Z","endAt":"2026-10-20T11:30:00Z","meetingInstructions":"Use the same mutually agreed meeting point.","reason":"Manager proposes a replacement time for customer approval."}

### Decline a pending reschedule and retain the previously confirmed appointment.
POST {{conversation}}/viewings/{{viewingId}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{viewingVersion}},"reason":"The replacement time is unsuitable; keep the original slot."}

### Cancel an active viewing; cancellation also remains possible after listing withdrawal.
POST {{conversation}}/viewings/{{viewingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{viewingVersion}},"reason":"Please cancel this appointment."}

### Manager records an outcome after the confirmed appointment ends.
# /no-show uses the same shape; this is an operational attendance record.
POST {{conversation}}/viewings/{{viewingId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{viewingVersion}},"reason":"The viewing took place and has ended."}

### Private property calendar: at most 31 days per request.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/viewings/calendar?from=2026-10-20T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-21T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Open the one shared conversation for your executed lease.
# Manager alternative: POST /api/v1/organizations/{org}/properties/{property}/leases/{lease}/conversations.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","channel":"SHARED"}

### Open an accepted provider job thread. Only maintenance supports PROCUREMENT.
# Tenant alternative: POST /api/v1/me/work-requests/{work}/conversations with SHARED.
# Maintenance manager alternative: POST /api/v1/organizations/{org}/properties/{property}/work-requests/{work}/conversations.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/service-jobs/{{workId}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","channel":"SHARED"}

### Author withdrawal within 15 minutes. The original is retained as protected evidence.
POST {{conversation}}/messages/{{messageId}}/redact
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","reason":"I shared this text in error."}

### Report another party's message privately. This does not freeze or refund funds.
POST {{conversation}}/messages/{{messageId}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","category":"OTHER","reason":"Please review this particular message for inappropriate content."}

### Reporter's own case status; does not grant new conversation rights.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me/conversation-reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Moderation metadata queue: no message text or report reasons.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/conversation-reports?status=OPEN&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{moderatorToken}}

### Independent operator explicitly claims the single-message case.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/conversation-reports/{{reportId}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{moderatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{caseVersion}},"password":"{{moderatorPassword}}","reason":"Claiming this report for an independent moderation review."}

### Assigned operator only. This read is audited and contains only the reported message.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/conversation-reports/{{reportId}}/evidence
Authorization: Bearer {{moderatorToken}}

### Resolve with REDACT or NO_ACTION, preserving original evidence and decision history.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/conversation-reports/{{reportId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{moderatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{caseVersion}},"resolution":"REDACT","password":"{{moderatorPassword}}","reason":"The reported message should be withheld from ordinary readers."}

### Or release an unresolved assigned case; evidence access ends immediately.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/conversation-reports/{{reportId}}/release
Authorization: Bearer {{moderatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{caseVersion}},"password":"{{moderatorPassword}}","reason":"Returning this unresolved case for another independent operator."}

### Close only after active viewing appointments are resolved.
POST {{conversation}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{conversationVersion}},"reason":"This conversation can be closed."}
